<ContentLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Calorie Calculator Free"
  h1="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Calorie Calculator Free handles your data. Spoiler: calculations run in your browser and we don't collect your health information."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
  updated="January 2025"
  showCta={false}
>
  <p>Your privacy matters to us. This policy explains what information Calorie Calculator Free ("we", "us") does and does not collect when you use caloriecalculatorfree.com.</p>

  <h2>Calculations stay on your device</h2>
  <p>All of our calculators run entirely in your web browser using client-side JavaScript. The personal details you enter — age, height, weight, measurements, and goals — are never transmitted to or stored on our servers. When you close the tab, that data is gone unless your browser has saved a recent result locally for your own convenience.</p>

  <h2>Local storage</h2>
  <p>To improve your experience, we may store small pieces of data in your browser's local storage, such as your theme preference (light or dark) and your most recent calculation results. This information lives only on your device, is never sent to us, and can be cleared at any time through your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>Advertising and third-party vendors</h2>
  <p>This site may display advertising served by third-party networks such as Google AdSense. These vendors may use cookies, web beacons, or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. The advertising identifiers we use include the Google publisher ID <code>pub-5576608603923233</code>.</p>
  <p>Google and other third-party vendors may use advertising cookies (including the <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DoubleClick cookie</a>) to serve ads based on your interests. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting the <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>, and you can control cookies through your browser settings or industry opt-out tools such as <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YourAdChoices</a>.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We may use privacy-respecting, aggregated analytics to understand which pages are popular and how the site performs. Where used, this data is anonymized and cannot be used to identify you individually. We do not sell or share personal data.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our core calculators do not require cookies to function. Any cookies present are limited to essential functionality, anonymous analytics, or advertising personalization as described above. You can clear or block cookies in your browser at any time; doing so may affect how ads are served but will not break the calculators.</p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>Our content may link to external websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their policies.</p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Our services are intended for general audiences and are not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected by the "last updated" date above.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Email <a href="mailto:calgroupofficial@gmail.com">calgroupofficial@gmail.com</a> (or our alternate, <a href="mailto:topg8086@gmail.com">topg8086@gmail.com</a>).</p>
</ContentLayout>
